  "description": "FUYMAR crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H128 Co4 Gd4 N8 O40. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 10 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co4 (Co) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.350-4.219 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.41-116.85°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H128Co4Gd4N8O40. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
